Files that contain derived material:

  src/hook_integrity_kit/gateconfig.py
      Adapted from scripts/hooks/config-protection.js: the gate-config
      protection hook, the protected basename list (ESLint, Prettier, Biome,
      Ruff, shellcheck, stylelint and markdownlint entries), allowing
      first-time creation, excluding pyproject.toml, case-insensitive basename
      matching, lstat-based existence that fails closed on stat errors, and
      refusing a payload too large to examine. Re-implemented in Python.

  src/hook_integrity_kit/profile.py
      Follows the vocabulary of scripts/lib/hook-flags.js: the
      minimal / standard / strict hook profiles and a comma-separated list of
      disabled hooks. No code copied.

